                                "sense_id": "a8d243d0-20fb-3090-81bf-2d676bc0844f",
                                "text": "Schließlich ist die Wellenfunktion Ψ(x), wie sie oben angegeben ist, nicht normalisierbar.",
                                "translation": "Finally, the wave function Ψ(x), written as it is above, is not normalizable.",
                                "english": "Finally, the wave function Ψ(x), written as it is above, is not normalizable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "625fb139-7f97-4f44-a8fb-e76c8530a206",
                                "sense_id": "a8d243d0-20fb-3090-81bf-2d676bc0844f",
                                "text": "Die alternativen Lösungen mit ansteigender Exponentialfunktion (e^(K|x|)) sind nicht möglich, da sie nicht normalisierbar sind (eᴷˣ geht nicht gegen null im Unendlichen).",
                                "translation": "The alternative solutions with increasing exponential function (e^(K|x|)) are not possible, as they are not normalizable (eᴷˣ does not go towards zero at infinity [i.e.: as x goes towards infinity].",
                                "english": "The alternative solutions with increasing exponential function (e^(K|x|)) are not possible, as they are not normalizable (eᴷˣ does not go towards zero at infinity [i.e.: as x goes towards infinity]."
                            },
